{"sourceUrl":"https://cmee.nuaa.edu.cn/2026/0721/c17776a405879/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:42.456250+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cmee.nuaa.edu.cn/2026/0721/c17776a405879/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span>欢迎报考南京航空航天大学机电学院推荐免试研究生！为进一步优化生源结构，提高生源质量，不断探索选拔高层次拔尖创新人才途径，我院决定开展选拔优秀推免生攻读</span><span>2027</span><span>年硕士、博士研究生工作。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong><span>一、</span></strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span>招生类型</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>学院</span></span></span><span><span>招收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生和直接攻读博士学位研究生（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>简称“直博生”）</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong><span>二、申请基本</span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong><span>条件</span></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>身体健康状况符合国家和</span></span><span><span><span>我校</span></span></span><span><span>规定的体检要求。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span>具备研究生培养潜质，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业素养。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span><span>满足《</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span>年全国硕士研究生招生工作管理规定》要求的其他条件。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>预计可获得或已经获得所在本科学校推免资格的考生均可报名，暂未确定是否可以获得推荐免试资格的考生可先行</span></span><span><span><span>报名</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>三、申请流程</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>1.</span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>研究生</span></span><span><span><span>报考</span></span></span><span><span>服务系统开放时间为</span></span><span><span><span>即日起—</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span><span><span>日。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>2.</span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>登录南京航空航天大</span></span><span><span><span>学</span></span></span><span><span>研究生报考服务系统，网址：</span></span></span></span><span><span>http://yzsbm.nuaa.edu.cn/logon</span></span><span><span>，选择“信息登记管理”，注册并登录系统，填写相关信息，并上传所有申报材料的电子版。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>前期已通过该系统报名参加学院实验室开放日等活动的学生，报名信息自动转为预报名信息（系统相同，账号密码不变），无需重复报名。所有学生如需修改报名信息，请在报名截止时间之前联系学院研究生招生办公室退回，修改完成后重新提交。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>3.</span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span>电子申请材料提交要求</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span>由所在学校院系的教务部门加盖公章的本科学习成绩单，成绩要能反映排名情况；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span>大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单，以及其他能反映英语水平的材料；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span>学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的成果）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span>各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>请将</span></span></span><span><span>上述</span></span><span><span><span>全部</span></span></span><span><span>申请材料电子版按编号顺序</span></span><span><span><span>合并为</span></span></span><span><span>形成一个</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>文档，在</span></span><span><span><span>学院规定的时间内通过</span></span></span><span><span>系统</span></span><span><span><span>上传</span></span></span><span><span>提交。提交</span></span><span><span><span>截止</span></span></span><span><span>时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span>日。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>申请人提供的材料必须真实。</span></span><span><span><span>若</span></span></span><span><span>提</span></span><span><span><span>交</span></span></span><span><span>虚假</span></span><span><span><span>材料</span></span></span><span><span>或不符合报考条件</span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span>一经</span></span><span><span><span>查实</span></span></span><span><span>，即取消</span></span><span><span><span>其拟</span></span></span><span><span>录取资格</span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span>入学资格</span></span><span><span><span>或学籍</span></span></span><span><span>，并</span></span><span><span><span>依据</span></span></span><span><span>教育部相关规定</span></span><span><span><span>予以</span></span></span><span><span>严肃处理，</span></span><span><span><span>相关</span></span></span><span><span>责任由</span></span><span><span><span>申请人自行</span></span></span><span><span>承担。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>4.</span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span>材料审核</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span><span>根据报名情况，对申请人提交的材料进行审核，择优确定综合考核入围人员名单</span></span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>并</span></span></span><span><span>通知</span></span><span><span><span>入围</span></span></span><span><span>的申请人参加综合考核</span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>未入围综合考核的申请人不再另行通知。（请随时关注学院官网的后续考核通知）。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>5.</span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span>综合考核</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>学院依据上级政策开展综合考核工作。请申请人关注学院官网通知，根据学院接收推免生工作安排，参加学院组织的综合考核。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>考核形式以综合面试为主，学院将根据综合考核成绩择优录取。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>四、支持政策</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>我校针对</span></span><span><span><span>录取的</span></span></span><span><span>推免生实施“创新英才”培养计划，主要内容如下：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>入选推免生可在大四期间</span></span><span><span><span>提前</span></span></span><span><span>修读硕士、博士研究生课程，成绩合格后，认定为硕士、博士生学习阶段学分。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>提前选择导师，优先推荐高水平指导教师，大四阶段提前进入导师科研团队。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>本科毕业设计可选择研究生导师</span></span><span><span><span>的</span></span></span><span><span>相关课题。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>本科阶段可申请（主持或参与）各类研究生创新基金项目资助。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>根据相关管理办法，可优先支持参加跨学科协同培养；优先获得出国短期访学项目和国际学术交流基金资助；获得直博资格的研究生，短期访学资助期限可择优延长至</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>~</span></span></span><span><span>12</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>个月；直博生优先选拔进入学校</span></span><span><span><span>研究生</span></span></span><span><span>拔尖创新人才“引航计划”。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6.</span></span><span><span>本培养计划内的硕士研究生，优先推荐硕博连读。</span></span></p><p><span><span>7.</span></span><span><span><span><span>经导师</span></span><span><span><span>同意、</span></span></span><span><span>学院和研究生院审核</span></span><span><span><span>通过后</span></span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span><span>可依据</span></span></span><span><span>相关</span></span><span><span><span>管理</span></span></span><span><span>办法申请提前</span></span><span><span><span>进行</span></span></span><span><span>研究生学位论文答辩。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>8.</span></span><span><span><span><span>在符合我校招收推免生</span></span><span><span><span>有关要求</span></span></span><span><span>的前提下，满足报考专业</span></span><span><span><span>要求</span></span></span><span><span>可跨专业报考。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>9.“</span></span><span><span><span><span>创新英才”培养计划</span></span><span><span><span>须</span></span></span><span><span>在报名系统中申请，并在考核时与学院进行确认。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong><span>五</span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong><span>、其他说明</span></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请人正式推免志愿填报，须在教育部规定时间段登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址：</span></span></span><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span></span><span><span><span>），依次完成志愿填报、缴费、复试确认、待录取确认等流程。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>未参加我院预报名的推免生，可在教育部全国推免服务系统开通后直接报名，学院将根据生源及各专业招生计划，决定是否发放复试通知、组织复试考核，具体安排以学院通知为准。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>本通知内容若与上级教育主管部门后续印发文件不一致，以上级最新正式文件为准，由研究生院负责解释。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong><span>六</span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong><span>、</span></strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>咨询电话：</span></span><span><span>025-84890249</span></span></p><p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span><span><span><a href=\"mailto:meeyzb@nuaa.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>meeyzb@nuaa.edu.cn</span></a></span></span></p><p><span><span>学院网址：</span></span><span><span><a href=\"http://cmee.nuaa.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://cmee.nuaa.edu.cn</span></a></span></span></p><p><span><span>综合考核安排、进入考核名单等通知将通过学院网站公布，请随时关注学院官网</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>人才培养</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>研究生招生栏目下的通知。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>机电学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"84719d40b81089e91a79efa1481ebcd40fffb11db3a69a0a077ec7c02ec9da4a","textLength":1930,"sourceSha256":"6de32ffbfe0c89339e14b3b94a0fc11887bfb7f16a75fec1b23803ae11026036","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-557870f47cb18c57eb1d","title":"2026年南京航空航天大学机电学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:42.456250+00:00"}
